    "detailed_description": "Hunt for the traitor! <br><br>Board submarine Kursk K-141 and stop a criminal organisation stealing Russian weapon systems! You are agent Belyaeva, a secret agent hunting the criminal mastermind. After an undercover partner goes missing you must find the culprit before Kursk K-141 and the truth fall to the bottom of the ocean!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve unique puzzles, engage with interesting characters, and hunt for clues in your search for the truth!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore nearly 50 beautiful locations from towns to Kursk K-141\u2019s submarine chambers</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play through 9 thrilling chapters as you hunt for the traitor!</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>11 mini-game challenges test your skills and wit</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Set in Russia and based on a real-life event, explore a beautiful recreation of submarine Kursk K-141</li></ul>",
